/P 20 0 R
/E (1\) Integrating additional sensors, including smoke and temperature detectors, across various vehicle components could refine the accuracy of early thermal runaway detection and other pre-combustion indicators.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [253]
>>
endobj
275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 20 0 R
/E (2\) Future work should explore the inclusion of batteries to assess the interval between battery ignition and viable escape opportunities, considering door release timings. Such investigations are expected to yield insights into actual escape durations.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [254]
>>
endobj
276 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 20 0 R
/E (3\) Subsequent research should examine a wider range of scenarios to design an autonomous door release system capable of facilitating unassisted escapes from vehicle fires, even in scenarios where occupants are incapacitated, minimizing risk to both occupants and potential rescuers.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [255]
>>
endobj
